{"id":30,"slug":"witch_doctor","name":"巫医","en":"Witch Doctor","aliases":["巫医","wd"],"attr":"int","attrLabel":"智力","attack":"远程","roles":["辅助","爆发","控制"],"positions":[5],"positionLabels":["5 号位"],"positionNames":["硬辅 / 保人"],"lanes":["优势路"],"complexity":1,"complexityLabel":"简单","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/witch_doctor.png","art":"assets/heroes/art/witch_doctor.jpg","card":"assets/heroes/cards/witch_doctor.png","winrate":52.07,"pickrate":16.55,"trend":[52.28,52.03,52.18,51.98,51.95,52.06,51.49],"delta":-0.79,"pubPick":634539,"pubWin":330394,"proPick":25,"proWin":10,"proBan":8,"lore":"一个轮廓不匀的瘦长身影迈着怪异的步伐纵横在战场上，寻找着敌人的致命弱点，用他可怕的才能造成严重的伤害。无论他那扭曲的身体是被打断的还是先天的，没有人可以质疑身怀的力量。巫医扎瓦克用他的长杖猛击地面前进，四处散播迷信、巫术和咒语。他在阿克图拉岛的高原地带学习了魔法知识并磨练娴熟，现在精准地用到他的敌人身上。治疗友军，践踏敌人，扎瓦克可以成为你最好的战友，或者最坏的敌人。","hype":"巫医可以为团队提供所需的一切。持续的治疗、眩晕和诅咒保证了团队每个人头，强大的终极技能则让他自己在舞蹈中毁灭敌人，他技能的全面实在是少有匹敌。","npe":"召唤高伤害的死亡守卫","stats":{"health":560,"healthRegen":2.25,"mana":339,"manaRegen":1.1,"damage":"48–58","armor":2.2,"magicResistance":25,"moveSpeed":300,"attackRange":550,"attackRate":1.7,"turnRate":0.6,"sightDay":1800,"sightNight":800,"str":{"base":20,"gain":2.1},"agi":{"base":13,"gain":1.4},"int":{"base":22,"gain":3.1}},"abilities":[{"id":5138,"key":"witch_doctor_paralyzing_cask","name":"麻痹药剂","en":"Paralyzing Cask","desc":"抛出一个装满麻痹粉末的药剂，在敌方单位之间弹跳，眩晕击中的敌人并造成伤害。每次弹跳都会提升伤害。","lore":"巫医回收倒下的友军和敌人的尸骨，磨成粉末用作他的符咒和炼丹术的材料。","notes":["目标可以受到多次作用，只要附近有其他单位可以进行弹跳。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"hero_duration","label":"眩晕时间","value":"0.8 秒"},{"key":"base_damage","label":"基础伤害","value":"55 / 70 / 85 / 100"},{"key":"bounces","label":"弹跳次数","value":"3 / 4 / 5 / 6"},{"key":"bounce_bonus_damage","label":"每次弹跳增加伤害","value":"20"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"20 / 18 / 16 / 14 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"80 / 100 / 120 / 140"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"600"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/witch_doctor_paralyzing_cask.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5139,"key":"witch_doctor_voodoo_restoration","name":"巫毒疗法","en":"Voodoo Restoration","desc":"巫医集中魔力治疗附近的友军单位，开启巫毒疗法后会持续消耗巫医的魔法。","lore":"扎瓦克的药酒不仅可以用来戏弄对手，用来治疗小伤也不错。","notes":["治疗间隔为0.33秒。","对减益免疫单位有效。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"mana_per_second","label":"每秒消耗魔法","value":"9 / 12 / 15 / 18"},{"key":"radius","label":"作用范围","value":"650"},{"key":"heal","label":"治疗","value":"20 / 30 / 40 / 50"},{"key":"self_only_heal_percentage","label":"自身治疗","value":"0% / 0% / 0% / 0%"}],"chips":[{"label":"魔法","value":"25"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/witch_doctor_voodoo_restoration.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5140,"key":"witch_doctor_maledict","name":"巫蛊咒术","en":"Maledict","desc":"对一个较小区域内所有敌方英雄和玩家控制的目标施放诅咒，他们将每秒受到固定伤害，并且从诅咒开始每4秒根据失去的血量再受到爆发伤害。","lore":"用对了巫毒法术会让敌人后悔招惹巫医。","notes":["受到作用的英雄如果在结算时当前血量高于原血量，则额外伤害为0。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"radius","label":"作用范围","value":"200"},{"key":"bonus_damage","label":"爆发伤害","value":"16% / 24% / 32% / 40%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"30 / 26 / 22 / 18 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"105 / 110 / 115 / 120"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"600"},{"label":"持续时间","value":"12 秒"},{"label":"伤害","value":"18 / 22 / 26 / 30"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/witch_doctor_maledict.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":632,"key":"witch_doctor_voodoo_switcheroo","name":"巫毒变身术","en":"Voodoo Switcheroo","desc":"巫医暂时变成死亡守卫，死亡守卫的攻击速度有所降低。这段时间内自己为隐藏状态。","lore":"","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"2.5 秒"},{"key":"attack_speed_reduction","label":"攻击速度降低","value":"45%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"50 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"200"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/witch_doctor_voodoo_switcheroo.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1257,"key":"witch_doctor_gris_gris","name":"驱邪护符","en":"Gris-Gris","desc":"巫医获得了驱邪护符，这件物品无法丢弃或放在背包里。拥有者阵亡时，死亡损失金钱的100%会加入到该物品中，物品被消耗后将退回这些金钱。驱邪护符的价值每3秒会增加1金。\n\n右键点击可以消耗这件物品，并将其永久移除。","lore":"","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[],"chips":[],"type":"innate","typeLabel":"先天技能","icon":"assets/abilities/witch_doctor_gris_gris.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5141,"key":"witch_doctor_death_ward","name":"死亡守卫","en":"Death Ward","desc":"持续施法 - 召唤一个死亡守卫，会优先攻击其攻击距离内的敌方英雄。最多持续8秒。死亡守卫拥有50%额外必中率。","lore":"巫医跳起他的传统巫毒舞蹈，在生者的梦中作祟。","notes":["死亡守卫是无敌的，只有在巫医被打断或持续时间结束后才会被摧毁。","死亡守卫可以受到控制，选择攻击特定目标。","死亡守卫每0.22秒攻击一次。"],"shard":"","scepter":"死亡守卫的攻击会向附近英雄弹射。","values":[{"key":"damage","label":"攻击力","value":"60 / 90 / 120"},{"key":"attack_range_tooltip","label":"攻击距离","value":"600 / 625 / 650"},{"key":"bounce_radius","label":"弹射范围","value":"0","scepter":"575"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"100 / 90 / 80 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"200 / 200 / 200"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"500"}],"type":"ultimate","typeLabel":"终极技能","icon":"assets/abilities/witch_doctor_death_ward.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true}],"talents":[{"level":10,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_witch_doctor_4","name":"--25% 巫毒疗法每秒消耗魔法","en":"-25% Voodoo Restoration Mana Per Second"},{"key":"special_bonus_hp_200","name":"+200 生命","en":"+200 Health"}]},{"level":15,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_witch_doctor_6","name":"--3.0秒 麻痹药剂冷却","en":"-3.0s Paralyzing Cask Cooldown"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_witch_doctor_7","name":"+4秒 巫蛊咒术持续时间","en":"+4s Maledict Duration"}]},{"level":20,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_witch_doctor_maledict_spread","name":"巫蛊咒术爆发在75范围内造成800%伤害","en":"Maledict bursts deal 75% damage in a 800 AoE "},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_witch_doctor_2","name":"巫毒疗法+1% 目标最大生命值治疗","en":"+1% Target Max Health Voodoo Restoration Heal"}]},{"level":25,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_witch_doctor_3","name":"+6 麻痹药剂弹跳","en":"+6 Paralyzing Cask Bounces"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_witch_doctor_5","name":"+40 死亡守卫攻击力","en":"+40 Death Ward Damag